# Assignment 5 - Employee Registration System

## Description

This assignment implements a simple Bash script called `employee.sh`.

The script asks the user to enter:

- Employee Name
- Age
- Department
- Salary

After collecting the information, it displays all entered data in a formatted output.

## Files

- employee.sh
- README.md

## How to Run

Make the script executable:

```bash
chmod +x employee.sh
```

Run the script:

```bash
./employee.sh
```

## Example Output

```
========== Employee Registration ==========

Enter Employee Name: Mohamed
Enter Age: 22
Enter Department: Mechatronics
Enter Salary: 12000

========== Employee Information ==========
Employee Name : Mohamed
Age           : 22
Department    : Mechatronics
Salary        : 12000
```